gaIl(){return"What the shares you sold cost you, buying fees included (shares sold \xd7 their average cost at the time of each sale).\n\nConverted at today's exchange rates."},
gaIm(){return"Realized gain/loss as a percentage of what the sold shares cost.\n\nP/L % = Realized P/L \xf7 Total Invested\n\nTotal Invested uses the average cost (AVCO) at the moment of each sell. Dividends are included in Realized P/L. Note: your broker may show a different figure if they use FIFO."},
